# Stable spec ID: iba-singapore-sling. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(gin) 30 ml
(cherry liqueur @ Sangue Morlacco) 15 ml
(orange liqueur @ Cointreau) 7.5 ml
(herbal liqueur @ DOM Bénédictine) 7.5 ml
(pineapple juice, fresh) 120 ml
(lime: juice, fresh) 15 ml
(grenadine syrup) 10 ml
(bitters @ Angostura) 1 dash

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(Hurricane glass)

::instructions
<shake, all measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a (Hurricane glass)>
<garnish, with pineapple and maraschino cherry>

